{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43555","headline":"春池泛舟联句 · 裴度","name":"春池泛舟联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤池新雨後，池上好风光。\n取酒愁春尽，留宾喜日长。\n柳丝迎画舸，水镜写雕梁。\n潭洞迷仙府，烟霞认醉乡。\n莺声随笑语，竹色入壶觞。\n晚景含澄澈，时芳得艳阳。\n飞凫拂轻浪，绿柳暗回塘。\n逸韵追安石，高居胜辟强。\n杯停新令举，诗动彩牋忙。\n顾谓同来客，欢游不可忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}